{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o043c","title":"京都大疫","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o043c-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"京都大疫","evidence":["mingdi-e-o043c-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":235,"label":"正月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y235","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o043","basis":"正月"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o043c-q","mingdi-q-o043","mingdi-q-b-e98ed256e58910694910"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o043c-q","source_order":[3,293,"O043c"],"order":873}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o043c-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-9b32a12fd737552ea52d","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月，戊子〖1〗，以大将军司马宣王为太尉。己亥〖2〗。复置朔方郡。京都大疫。丁巳〖3〗，皇太后崩。乙亥〖4〗，陨石于寿光县〖5〗。三月，庚寅〖6〗，葬文德郭后。营陵于首阳陵涧西〖7〗，如终制。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":292,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":102,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-e98ed256e58910694910","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-e98ed256e58910694910","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：青龙三年（公元 235）。明帝将司马懿提升为太尉，使他让出大将军一职，出自深层次政治考量。太尉作为三公之首，品级地位虽然略高于大将军，但是在控制军事实权和亲近皇帝的程度上，却比不上后者。明帝是要为曹氏亲族的年轻将领腾出这一重要位置，与异姓元勋重臣进行力量平衡，从而保证皇权安定稳固。戊子：旧历初八日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":297,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ddf87e6819a0a2dfe019","start":0,"end":156,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o043","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-9b32a12fd737552ea52d","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月，戊子〖1〗，以大将军司马宣王为太尉。己亥〖2〗。复置朔方郡。京都大疫。丁巳〖3〗，皇太后崩。乙亥〖4〗，陨石于寿光县〖5〗。三月，庚寅〖6〗，葬文德郭后。营陵于首阳陵涧西〖7〗，如终制。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":292,"anchor":n